</font><font><span>2）；</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>10.</span></font></span><span><font><span>北京第二外国语学院研究生推免生复试考生诚信承诺书（见附件</span></font><font><span>2），签订前须仔细阅读《北京第二外国语学院复试考场规则》。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><br/></span></font></span></p><p><span><span>凡未在规定时间内进行资格审查材料提交或资格审查未通过的考生一律不予录取。如因特殊原因确实无法完成相关材料的准备，可以选择其他材料进行佐证，或向我单位提出申请，先参加复试，规定时间内补齐材料。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span><section><p><span>二、发送考生复试通知</span></p></section></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>资格审查通过后，我院将于9月17日19:00前通过系统通知、短信或电话等方式联系考生，告知复试报到地点及考试安排等相关事宜，请各位考生在此期间保持通讯方式畅通。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span><section><p><span>三、缴费</span></p></section></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.</span></span><font><span><span>缴费金额：复试费</span></span></font><font><span><span>100元/人。（注：若是参加我院不同专业的考试，每次均需缴费）</span></span></font></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><font><span><span>缴费形式：网上缴费。</span></span></font></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><font><span><span>缴费时间：</span></span></font><font><span><span>9月18日12:00前，若未准时缴费可能影响复试资格或录取资格。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>学院通知允许参加复试的考生直接扫描二维码填写个人信息后缴费，缴费时请备注报考院系及专业等信息。缴费后因各种原因无法参加复试的，已缴费用不予退还。</span></span></font></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span><section><p><span>四、报到</span></p></section></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><spa