<span>6</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span><section><p><span>六、考生在中国研招网的“推免服务系统”填报专业志愿</span></p></section></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>请已预报名推免生务必于9月21日9时系统开通推免生报名功能后在中国研招网的“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（https://yz.chsi.cn/tm/）进行正式报名，填报的专业及方向须与预报名一致。9月22日8时后学校将根据申请人的复试成绩，在“推免服务系统”中向通过复试且符合要求的推免生依次发送“复试通知”及“待录取”通知，择优录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>推免生须按照要求在规定的时间内点击确认“待录取”后，才能获得推免拟录取资格，完成最终拟录取。未进行确认的，将按成绩递补录取其他考生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>确认待录取后，学校不接受考生取消待录取，请考生谨慎确认。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span><section><p><span>七、其它说明</span></p></section></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span